flowchart TD
    Start([Member clicks Enrol]) --> AuthCheck{Logged in as Member?}
    AuthCheck -->|No| LoginRedirect[Redirect to login]
    AuthCheck -->|Yes| BalanceCheck{Sufficient credits?}
    BalanceCheck -->|No| ShowError1[Show insufficient credits]
    BalanceCheck -->|Yes| CapacityCheck{Session has capacity?}
    CapacityCheck -->|No| ShowError2[Show session full]
    CapacityCheck -->|Yes| FormValid{Form complete?}
    FormValid -->|No| ShowError3[Highlight required fields]
    FormValid -->|Yes| TxStart[Begin DB transaction]
    TxStart --> Debit[Debit credits and create enrollment]
    Debit --> Commit{Commit success?}
    Commit -->|No| Rollback[Rollback and show error]
    Commit -->|Yes| Notify[Send confirmation notification]
    Notify --> Done([Redirect to My Programs])
